IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `dg-core`
IMPORT `dg4-s220-inspection`
IMPORT `dg4-s220-court-orders`

-- Tests of dg4-s220-inspection.l4 and dg4-s220-court-orders.l4. Expected values are written by hand from the text of s 220
-- (de-code-t8-ch1-2026-10-01.txt, lines 841-888), beside each assertion, never copied from the modules' own output.

§ `Tests of s 220`

§§ `(a)(1): books and records`

-- the demand is dated 1 June 2026: the 3 years preceding run from 1 June 2023
#ASSERT `s 220(a)(1) the record is among the books and records` `the certificate of incorporation, with any agreement or other instrument incorporated by reference in it` (YMD 1990 1 1) (YMD 2026 6 1)
#ASSERT `s 220(a)(1) the record is among the books and records` `the bylaws then in effect, with any agreement or other instrument incorporated by reference in them` (YMD 1990 1 1) (YMD 2026 6 1)
#ASSERT `s 220(a)(1) the record is among the books and records` `minutes of meetings of stockholders and signed consents evidencing action taken by stockholders without a meeting` (YMD 2023 6 1) (YMD 2026 6 1)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(a)(1) the record is among the books and records` `minutes of meetings of stockholders and signed consents evidencing action taken by stockholders without a meeting` (YMD 2023 5 31) (YMD 2026 6 1))
#ASSERT `s 220(a)(1) the record is among the books and records` `communications in writing or by electronic transmission to stockholders generally` (YMD 2026 6 1) (YMD 2026 6 1)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(a)(1) the record is among the books and records` `communications in writing or by electronic transmission to stockholders generally` (YMD 2022 1 1) (YMD 2026 6 1))
#ASSERT `s 220(a)(1) the record is among the books and records` `annual financial statements of the corporation` (YMD 2024 12 31) (YMD 2026 6 1)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(a)(1) the record is among the books and records` `annual financial statements of the corporation` (YMD 2020 12 31) (YMD 2026 6 1))
-- a record dated after the demand is not one the 3 years preceding the demand reach
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(a)(1) the record is among the books and records` `annual financial statements of the corporation` (YMD 2026 12 31) (YMD 2026 6 1))
-- the board's minutes, board materials, s 122(18) agreements and questionnaires carry no time limit in (a)(1)
#ASSERT `s 220(a)(1) the record is among the books and records` `minutes of a meeting of the board of directors or a committee and records of an action of the board or a committee` (YMD 1999 1 1) (YMD 2026 6 1)
#ASSERT `s 220(a)(1) the record is among the books and records` `materials provided to the board of directors or a committee in connection with actions taken by it` (YMD 1999 1 1) (YMD 2026 6 1)
#ASSERT `s 220(a)(1) the record is among the books and records` `an agreement entered into under s 122(18)` (YMD 1999 1 1) (YMD 2026 6 1)
#ASSERT `s 220(a)(1) the record is among the books and records` `a director and officer independence questionnaire` (YMD 1999 1 1) (YMD 2026 6 1)
-- any other record is not "books and records"
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(a)(1) the record is among the books and records` `any other record of the corporation` (YMD 2026 1 1) (YMD 2026 6 1))
-- 3 years back from 29 February 2028 is 28 February 2025 (clamped)
#ASSERT `s 220(a)(1) the record is among the books and records` `annual financial statements of the corporation` (YMD 2025 2 28) (YMD 2028 2 29)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(a)(1) the record is among the books and records` `annual financial statements of the corporation` (YMD 2025 2 27) (YMD 2028 2 29))

§§ `(a)(2) to (5)`

#ASSERT `s 220(a)(2) the purpose is a proper purpose` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(a)(2) the purpose is a proper purpose` FALSE)
-- (a)(3): holder of record in a stock corporation, or beneficial owner of shares held in a voting trust or by a nominee on the person's behalf
#ASSERT `s 220(a)(3) the person is a stockholder for the purposes of this section` `a stock corporation` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 220(a)(3) the person is a stockholder for the purposes of this section` `a stock corporation` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 220(a)(3) the person is a stockholder for the purposes of this section` `a stock corporation` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(a)(3) the person is a stockholder for the purposes of this section` `a stock corporation` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
-- a member of a nonstock corporation is the equivalent (fork F-M); being a record holder of "stock" in a nonstock corporation is not the test
#ASSERT `s 220(a)(3) the person is a stockholder for the purposes of this section` `a nonstock corporation with membership interests` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(a)(3) the person is a stockholder for the purposes of this section` `a nonprofit nonstock corporation that is not charitable` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 220(a)(4) the entity is a subsidiary` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(a)(4) the entity is a subsidiary` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(a)(4) the entity is a subsidiary` FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 220(a)(5) the statement is under oath` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 220(a)(5) the statement is under oath` FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(a)(5) the statement is under oath` FALSE FALSE)

§§ `(b)(5) to (7): form and manner of the demand`

GIVEN writing IS A BOOLEAN
      oath IS A BOOLEAN
      other IS A BOOLEAN
      status IS A BOOLEAN
      evidence IS A BOOLEAN
      copy IS A BOOLEAN
      agent IS A BOOLEAN
      power IS A BOOLEAN
      directed IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 220(b) Demand`
`t220 demand` writing oath other status evidence copy agent power directed MEANS
    `s 220(b) Demand` WITH
        `the demand is in writing` IS writing
        `the demand is under oath` IS oath
        `the person is other than a record holder of stock in a stock corporation or a member of a nonstock corporation` IS other
        `the demand states the person's status as a stockholder` IS status
        `the demand is accompanied by documentary evidence of beneficial ownership of the stock` IS evidence
        `the demand states that the documentary evidence is a true and correct copy of what it purports to be` IS copy
        `an attorney or other agent seeks the inspection` IS agent
        `the demand is accompanied by a power of attorney or other writing authorizing the attorney or agent` IS power
        `the demand is directed to the corporation at its registered office in this State or at its principal place of business` IS directed

-- arguments: writing oath other-than-record-holder status evidence copy agent power directed
-- a record holder, in person, written, under oath, directed to the registered office
#ASSERT `s 220(b) the demand complies with this section respecting the form and manner of making demand` (`t220 demand` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(b) the demand complies with this section respecting the form and manner of making demand` (`t220 demand` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(b) the demand complies with this section respecting the form and manner of making demand` (`t220 demand` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(b) the demand complies with this section respecting the form and manner of making demand` (`t220 demand` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE))
-- (b)(5): a beneficial owner must state status, attach evidence, and state it is a true and correct copy
#ASSERT `s 220(b) the demand complies with this section respecting the form and manner of making demand` (`t220 demand` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(b) the demand complies with this section respecting the form and manner of making demand` (`t220 demand` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(b) the demand complies with this section respecting the form and manner of making demand` (`t220 demand` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(b) the demand complies with this section respecting the form and manner of making demand` (`t220 demand` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE))
-- (b)(6): an attorney or other agent needs a power of attorney or other writing
#ASSERT `s 220(b) the demand complies with this section respecting the form and manner of making demand` (`t220 demand` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(b) the demand complies with this section respecting the form and manner of making demand` (`t220 demand` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE))

§§ `(b)(2) and (b)(1): the conditions and the right`

-- (b)(2): all of a., b. and c.
#ASSERT `s 220(b)(2) the conditions for inspecting and copying the corporation's books and records are met` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(b)(2) the conditions for inspecting and copying the corporation's books and records are met` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(b)(2) the conditions for inspecting and copying the corporation's books and records are met` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(b)(2) the conditions for inspecting and copying the corporation's books and records are met` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(b)(2) the conditions for inspecting and copying the corporation's books and records are met` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(b)(2) the conditions for inspecting and copying the corporation's books and records are met` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE)
-- (b)(1)a.: the stock ledger and the list of stockholders need a stockholder, a demand in form and a proper purpose; not the (b)(2) conditions
#ASSERT `s 220(b)(1)a. the stockholder has the right to inspect and copy the stock ledger and the list of stockholders` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(b)(1)a. the stockholder has the right to inspect and copy the stock ledger and the list of stockholders` FALSE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(b)(1)a. the stockholder has the right to inspect and copy the stock ledger and the list of stockholders` TRUE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(b)(1)a. the stockholder has the right to inspect and copy the stock ledger and the list of stockholders` TRUE TRUE FALSE)
-- books and records: also the (b)(2) conditions and the definition
#ASSERT `s 220(b)(1)a. the stockholder has the right to inspect and copy the corporation's books and records` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(b)(1)a. the stockholder has the right to inspect and copy the corporation's books and records` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(b)(1)a. the stockholder has the right to inspect and copy the corporation's books and records` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(b)(1)a. the stockholder has the right to inspect and copy the corporation's books and records` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(b)(1)a. the stockholder has the right to inspect and copy the corporation's books and records` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE)
-- (b)(1)b.: a subsidiary's records: possession and control; or could obtain through control with neither breach nor right to deny
#ASSERT `s 220(b)(1)b. the stockholder has the right to inspect and copy the subsidiary's books and records` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 220(b)(1)b. the stockholder has the right to inspect and copy the subsidiary's books and records` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(b)(1)b. the stockholder has the right to inspect and copy the subsidiary's books and records` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(b)(1)b. the stockholder has the right to inspect and copy the subsidiary's books and records` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(b)(1)b. the stockholder has the right to inspect and copy the subsidiary's books and records` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(b)(1)b. the stockholder has the right to inspect and copy the subsidiary's books and records` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE)

§§ `(b)(3) and (b)(4)`

#ASSERT `s 220(b)(3) the corporation may do it` `impose reasonable restrictions on the confidentiality, use or distribution of books and records` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 220(b)(3) the corporation may do it` `require, as a condition to producing books and records, that the stockholder agree that any information in them is deemed incorporated by reference in any complaint filed by or at the direction of the stockholder in relation to the subject matter referenced in the demand` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 220(b)(3) the corporation may do it` `redact a portion of the books and records produced` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(b)(3) the corporation may do it` `redact a portion of the books and records produced` TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(b)(3) the corporation may do it` `impose reasonable restrictions on the confidentiality, use or distribution of books and records` FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 220(b)(4)a. this section affects the stockholder's right to seek discovery of books and records from the corporation as any other litigant may` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 220(b)(4)a. this section affects the stockholder's right to seek discovery of books and records from the corporation as any other litigant may` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 220(b)(4)b. the power of a court independently of this chapter to compel production of corporate records for inspection may be exercised` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(b)(4)b. the power of a court independently of this chapter to compel production of corporate records for inspection may be exercised` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 220(b)(4)b. the power of a court independently of this chapter to compel production of corporate records for inspection may be exercised` FALSE FALSE

§§ `(c): the application to the Court of Chancery`

-- refused; or no reply within 5 business days after the demand (the 5th business day has ended)
#ASSERT `s 220(c) the stockholder may apply to the Court of Chancery for an order to compel the inspection` TRUE FALSE 0
#ASSERT `s 220(c) the stockholder may apply to the Court of Chancery for an order to compel the inspection` TRUE TRUE 0
#ASSERT `s 220(c) the stockholder may apply to the Court of Chancery for an order to compel the inspection` FALSE FALSE 5
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(c) the stockholder may apply to the Court of Chancery for an order to compel the inspection` FALSE FALSE 4)
#ASSERT `s 220(c) the stockholder may apply to the Court of Chancery for an order to compel the inspection` FALSE FALSE 12
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(c) the stockholder may apply to the Court of Chancery for an order to compel the inspection` FALSE TRUE 12)
#ASSERT `s 220(c) the court has jurisdiction to determine whether the person seeking inspection is entitled to the inspection sought` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(c) the court has jurisdiction to determine whether the person seeking inspection is entitled to the inspection sought` FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 220(c) the Court of Chancery may make the order` `a summary order that the corporation permit the stockholder to inspect the stock ledger, an existing list of stockholders and its other books and records and to make copies or extracts` TRUE
#ASSERT `s 220(c) the Court of Chancery may make the order` `an order that the corporation furnish the stockholder a list of its stockholders as of a specific date` TRUE
#ASSERT `s 220(c) the Court of Chancery may make the order` `a limitation or condition with reference to the inspection` TRUE
#ASSERT `s 220(c) the Court of Chancery may make the order` `such other or further relief as the Court deems just and proper` TRUE
#ASSERT `s 220(c) the Court of Chancery may make the order` `an order that books, documents and records, extracts or authenticated copies be brought within this State and kept in this State` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(c) the Court of Chancery may make the order` `a limitation or condition with reference to the inspection` FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 220(c) the stockholder must first pay the corporation the reasonable cost of obtaining and furnishing the list` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(c) the stockholder must first pay the corporation the reasonable cost of obtaining and furnishing the list` FALSE)
-- the burden of establishing, for books and records other than the ledger or list
#ASSERT `s 220(c) the stockholder has first established what the subsection requires for books and records other than the stock ledger and list of stockholders` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(c) the stockholder has first established what the subsection requires for books and records other than the stock ledger and list of stockholders` FALSE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(c) the stockholder has first established what the subsection requires for books and records other than the stock ledger and list of stockholders` TRUE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(c) the stockholder has first established what the subsection requires for books and records other than the stock ledger and list of stockholders` TRUE TRUE FALSE)
-- who bears the burden as to purpose
#ASSERT `s 220(c) the party who bears the burden of proof as to the purpose of the inspection` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST `a stockholder`
#ASSERT `s 220(c) the party who bears the burden of proof as to the purpose of the inspection` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST `the corporation`
#ASSERT `s 220(c) the party who bears the burden of proof as to the purpose of the inspection` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 220(c) the party who bears the burden of proof as to the purpose of the inspection` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `(d): a director`

#ASSERT `s 220(d) the director has the right to examine the stock ledger, the list of stockholders, the books and records and other corporate records` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(d) the director has the right to examine the stock ledger, the list of stockholders, the books and records and other corporate records` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(d) the director has the right to examine the stock ledger, the list of stockholders, the books and records and other corporate records` FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 220(d) the Court of Chancery may make the order` `a summary order that the corporation permit the director to inspect the stock ledger, the list of stockholders, the books and records and other corporate records and to make copies or extracts` TRUE
#ASSERT `s 220(d) the Court of Chancery may make the order` `a limitation or condition with reference to the inspection` TRUE
#ASSERT `s 220(d) the Court of Chancery may make the order` `such other and further relief as the Court deems just and proper` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(d) the Court of Chancery may make the order` `such other and further relief as the Court deems just and proper` FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 220(d) the party who bears the burden of proof that the inspection the director seeks is for an improper purpose` EQUALS `the corporation`

§§ `(e) to (h): more than the books and records`

-- (e): books and records within (a)(1), the ledger or list (ordered under (c)), or what (f) or (g) allow
#ASSERT `s 220(e) the Court of Chancery may order the corporation to produce the record in a stockholder's proceeding` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 220(e) the Court of Chancery may order the corporation to produce the record in a stockholder's proceeding` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 220(e) the Court of Chancery may order the corporation to produce the record in a stockholder's proceeding` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 220(e) the Court of Chancery may order the corporation to produce the record in a stockholder's proceeding` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(e) the Court of Chancery may order the corporation to produce the record in a stockholder's proceeding` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
-- (f): arguments: lacks c/e/g, listed, lacks i, met (b), functional equivalent, necessary and essential
#ASSERT `s 220(f) the Court of Chancery may order the corporation to produce the additional records constituting the functional equivalent` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(f) the Court of Chancery may order the corporation to produce the additional records constituting the functional equivalent` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(f) the Court of Chancery may order the corporation to produce the additional records constituting the functional equivalent` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(f) the Court of Chancery may order the corporation to produce the additional records constituting the functional equivalent` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(f) the Court of Chancery may order the corporation to produce the additional records constituting the functional equivalent` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE)
-- a listed corporation without its independence questionnaires: (f) reaches the functional equivalent
#ASSERT `s 220(f) the Court of Chancery may order the corporation to produce the additional records constituting the functional equivalent` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE
-- an unlisted corporation without them: (f) does not reach them
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(f) the Court of Chancery may order the corporation to produce the additional records constituting the functional equivalent` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE)
-- (g): met (b), compelling need, clear and convincing evidence
#ASSERT `s 220(g) the Court of Chancery may order the corporation to produce the other specific records` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(g) the Court of Chancery may order the corporation to produce the other specific records` FALSE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(g) the Court of Chancery may order the corporation to produce the other specific records` TRUE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 220(g) the Court of Chancery may order the corporation to produce the other specific records` TRUE TRUE FALSE)
-- (h)
#ASSERT `s 220(h) the Court of Chancery may impose reasonable restrictions as provided in paragraph (b)(3) on the records` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 220(h) the Court of Chancery may impose reasonable restrictions as provided in paragraph (b)(3) on the records` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
